course: dictionary
lesson: 840
title: Vitamins and the illness beriberi
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Beriberi is an illness that happens when food does not give your body enough vitamin B1, also called thiamine. Your body needs this vitamin to keep your muscles, nerves and heart working well.
explain: Read the clues in the sentence: «Japanese navy sailors who ate mostly white rice once fell ill with beriberi, an illness that makes the legs weak and numb, until doctors added other foods.» The words "ate mostly white rice" show the cause, and "until doctors added other foods" show the cure. The illness is beriberi; the missing vitamin is the reason it happens.
explain: Scientists call beriberi a deficiency disease, because it comes from too little of something the body needs. Scurvy is another one, caused by too little vitamin C. Both show why a balanced diet matters.
fact: «Beriberi» means an illness caused by not having enough vitamin B1 (thiamine) in food.
fact: Beriberi can weaken the muscles, nerves and heart.
fact: Long ago, beriberi was common where people ate mostly white polished rice.
fact: Brown rice, beans, meat and whole grains helped cure beriberi.
fact: Studying illnesses like beriberi helped scientists discover vitamins.
exercise: «Japanese navy sailors who ate mostly white rice once fell ill with beriberi.» What caused beriberi? | Catching a cold from another person | Being too hot in the sun | *Not having enough vitamin B1 in food | Eating too many vegetables
exercise: Which food helped cure beriberi, according to the lesson? | Sweets and fizzy drinks | *Brown rice | White polished rice | Only water
exercise: Scurvy and beriberi are both examples of deficiency diseases. What do they have in common? | Catching germs from animals | *Both come from too little of a vitamin in food | Both make people grow taller | Both come from too much sunshine
test: What does beriberi weaken? | *The muscles, nerves and heart | Only the hair | The eyes | Only the teeth
test: Which clue in the sentence shows the cause of beriberi? | the legs were weak and numb | *ate mostly white rice | fell ill with beriberi | until doctors added other foods
exam: What is the best way to stop beriberi, based on this lesson? | *Eat a balanced diet with brown rice, beans, meat and whole grains | Drink only water and nothing else | Stop eating all rice | Stay indoors all day
